# Landing visual experiment

Do not ship a flat cream SaaS hero.
Do not ship fake 3D / extruded ascii.

The `/` opening must have:

- scanned paper + light ink bleed
- crayon / wax-pencil markup (underline, bracket, circle, arrow, frame)
- reusable `.vellum` that veils ink/image underneath
- embodied hero treated as a **printed plate** from `bg_pic/04.jpeg` — **do not invent a body**
- tiny `new →` marquee
- crayon accent via `/?theme=cyan|coral|graphite|acid|violet|cobalt` (review only)
- flat crayon site-map sketch (not 3D)
- serial volumes as marked-up booklets
- minimal copy

Color experiments are **review only**. Do not merge. Do not recommend merge.

Do **not** redesign the rest of the site.

Hard rule:

```txt
no screenshots = no merge recommendation.
if it still looks like flat cards or fake 3D, the task failed.
```

Do not merge automatically.

Required screenshots for color review:

- `landing-cyan-desktop.png` / `landing-coral-desktop.png` / `landing-graphite-desktop.png` / `landing-acid-desktop.png`
- optional `landing-violet-desktop.png` / `landing-cobalt-desktop.png`
- `landing-cyan-mobile.png` / `landing-coral-mobile.png` / `landing-graphite-mobile.png` / `landing-acid-mobile.png`
- `crayon-mark-detail-cyan.png` / `vellum-over-ink-detail.png` / `serials-color-variants.png`
